/Alt (Flowchart comparing the exclusion and inclusion process of sweat samples using Flame Photometry and LAQUAtwin Na-11 methods. Both start with 184 samples/sessions. Steps show reasons for exclusion such as insufficient sweat, patch saturation, operator oversight, and data artifacts. The final results show 44 samples \(24%\) excluded for Flame Photometry and 42 sessions \(23%\) excluded for LAQUAtwin Na-11, with more artifacts manually repaired, leading to 142 sessions included \(77%\).)
